  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the International Year of Camelids 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Year aims to raise awareness of the contribution of camelids to livelihoods, food security and nutrition. 

The project is aligned with FAO?s Strategic Framework and contributes directly to all Priority Programme Areas of the Organization. Project activities will foster partnerships to support the implementation of the IYC at the global, regional and national levels, taking into consideration the existing FAO Strategies for partnerships with Civil Society Organizations and the Private Sector. The project will act as a catalyst for attracting voluntary contributions from donors, governments and institutions willing to support the implementation of the IYC Action Plan at the field level.</narrative>
  </description>
